130:I shake my head defeatedly.
131:{character:Nadeshiko}Haha!... Well, {var:player_nickname}, welcome to the world of motorcycles.
132:Nadeshiko walks up to the podium with the lesson plan she has prepared and starts to give a lecture gracefully. In this session, the instructor needs to teach students the function of various parts of a motorcycle.
133:From the very moment the trial lecture starts, it was clear to me that Nadeshiko has done her homework as she delivered the opening remarks without checking the notes even once. The vivid expression on her face when she talked about what one should pay attention to when driving based on her experiences made me, a veteran driver, nod in agreement. I even started discussing these things with her...
134:Wait! Isn't there something wrong with this rhythm?
135:{character:player}I'm sorry, Nadeshiko. Although we're having a nice chat, a beginner won't be able to understand what we're saying and follow the conversation.
136:{character:Nadeshiko}Which part are you referring to?
137:{character:player}For example, when troubleshooting the engine knocking failure, they'll need to know what that means first.
